      <phase>drilling</phase>
      <proprietaryCode>interruption -- stuck equipment</proprietaryCode>
      <state>fail</state>
      <stateDetailActivity>failure</stateDetailActivity>
      <comments>String packed off and got stuck at 2595 m MD in Shetland Gp while making connection. Torque increased to 32 kNm. Jarred down, freed string after 8 hrs. Cause: poor hole cleaning. Lesson: circulate hole clean before connections, keep flow rate above 3800 lpm.</comments>
    </activity>
    <activity>
      <dTimStart>2007-11-09T11:00:00+01:00</dTimStart>
      <dTimEnd>2007-11-09T16:00:00+01:00</dTimEnd>
      <md uom="m">2605</md>
      <phase>drilling</phase>
      <proprietaryCode>drilling -- drill</proprietaryCode>
      <state>ok</state>
      <comments>Erratic torque, torque spikes up to 30 kNm between 2598 m and 2605 m. Reduced RPM to 120 and WOB to 8 t.</comments>
    </activity>
  </drillReport>
