      <phase>drilling</phase>
      <proprietaryCode>interruption -- well control</proprietaryCode>
      <state>fail</state>
      <stateDetailActivity>failure</stateDetailActivity>
      <comments>Pit gain of 2.1 m3 observed at 3185 m MD. Flow check positive, shut in well. Kick circulated out with drillers method, mud weight raised from 1.25 to 1.32 sg. Cause: pore pressure higher than prognosis in Hugin Fm. Lesson: raise mud weight before drilling into Hugin sands.</comments>
    </activity>
